225 227 1043 (   1.1 Banked and Nonbanked Memory Organization) 1043 SB
225 405 1940 (The memory organization for a nonbanked CP/M 3 system is very simple, as shown in Figure 1-1.) 1940 SB
225 1580 1305 (                 Figure 1-1.  Nonbanked System Memory Organization) 1305 SB
225 1758 1659 (     In the nonbanked organization, physical memory consists of a single, contiguous) 1659 SB
