225 2127 1779 (          Functionally, the CP/M 3 operating system is composed of distinct modules.  Tran-) 1779 SB
225 2186 1799 (        sient programs can communicate with these modules to request system services.  Fig-) 1799 SB
225 2245 1770 (        ure 1-5 shows the regions where these modules reside in logical memory.  Note that) 1770 SB
225 2305 1740 (        from the transient program's perspective, Figure 1-5 is just a more detailed version) 1740 SB
225 2364 379 (        of Figure 1-4.) 379 SB
