225 2061 1657 (         This section reviews memory regions under CP/M 3, and then describes some) 1657 SB
225 2120 1774 (       details of region boundaries.  It then relates the sizes of various modules to the space) 1774 SB
225 2180 1763 (       avialable for the execution of transient programs.  Figure 1-6 reviews the location of) 1763 SB
225 2239 617 (       regions in logical memory.) 617 SB
