225 1884 1111 (      A SUBMIT command line has the following syntax:) 1111 SB
225 2002 798 (        SUBMIT <filespec> <parameters>) 798 SB
225 2120 1753 (    If the CCP identifies a command as a submit file, it automatically inserts the SUBMIT) 1753 SB
225 2180 1272 (    keyword into the command line as described in Section 1.6.2.) 1272 SB
1154 2830 92 (1-26) 92 SB
