225 878 1679 (           CP/M 3 cannot run unless CONIN: and CONOUT: are assigned to a physical) 1679 SB
225 937 1747 (         console.  The remaining logical devices can remain unassigned.  If a logical output) 1747 SB
225 996 1803 (         device is not assigned to a physical device, an output BDOS call to the logical device) 1803 SB
225 1055 1759 (         performs no action. If a logical input device is not assigned to a physical device, an) 1759 SB
225 1115 1684 (         input BDOS call to the logical device typically returns a CTRL-Z \(lAH\), which) 1684 SB
225 1174 1630 (         indicates end-of-file.  Note that these actions depend on your system's BIOS) 1630 SB
225 1233 435 (         implementation.) 435 SB
