225 2416 1691 (         Under CP/M 3, a file specification consists of four parts: the drive specifier, the) 1691 SB
225 2475 1771 (       filename field, the filetype field, and the file password field.  The general format for a) 1771 SB
225 2535 1035 (       command line file specification is shown below:) 1035 SB
225 2653 783 (            {d:}filename{.typ}{;password}) 783 SB
