225 2239 847 (            2.3.2 Disk and File Organization) 847 SB
32 0 0 50 50 0 0 1 45 /MSTT31c33d font
225 2357 1788 (              The BDOS file system can support from one to sixteen logical drives.  The maxi-) 1788 SB
225 2416 1757 (            mum file size supported on a drive is 32 megabytes.  The maximum capacity of a) 1757 SB
225 2475 1786 (            drive is determined by the data block size specified for the drive in the BIOS.  The) 1786 SB
225 2535 1731 (            data block size is the basic unit in which the BDOS allocates disk space to files.) 1731 SB
1154 2830 92 (2-11) 92 SB
225 92 452 (2.3 BDOS File System) 452 SB
1597 92 578 (CP/M 3 Programmer's Guide) 578 SB
