225 227 1096 (              d0 ... dn        filled-in by CP/M 3, reserved for) 1096 SB
225 286 617 (                               system use) 617 SB
225 405 1073 (              cr               current record to read or write in) 1073 SB
225 464 1111 (                               a sequential file operation, normally) 1111 SB
225 523 1071 (                               set to zero by the calling program) 1071 SB
225 582 1033 (                               when a file is opened or created) 1033 SB
