225 286 1605 (    Note: the CCP automatically discards all pending physical data buffers when it) 1605 SB
225 345 1654 (    receives control following a system warm start.  However, the BDOS file system) 1654 SB
225 405 1711 (    automatically makes a Flush Buffers call in the Close File function.  Thus, it is suffi-) 1711 SB
225 464 1722 (    cient to close a file to ensure that all pending physical buffers for that file are written) 1722 SB
225 523 274 (    to the disk.) 274 SB
