225 1413 1725 (          The System Reset function terminates the calling program and returns control to) 1725 SB
225 1472 1748 (       the CCP via a warm start sequence \(see Section 1.3.2\). Calling this function has the) 1748 SB
225 1531 1172 (       same effect as a 'ump to location 0000H of Page Zero.) 1172 SB
225 1650 1672 (          Note that the disk subsystem is not reset by System Reset under CP/M 3. The) 1672 SB
225 1709 1748 (       calling program can pass a return code to the CCP by calling Function 108, Get/Set) 1748 SB
225 1768 1718 (       Program Return Code, prior to making a System Reset call or jumping to location) 1718 SB
225 1827 240 (       0000H.) 240 SB
