225 345 1805 (         FCB into bytes d0 through dn of the FCB.  If the file is opened under user zero when) 1805 SB
225 405 1749 (         the current user number is not zero, interface attribute f8' is set to one in the user's) 1749 SB
225 464 1802 (         FCB.  In addition, if the referenced file is password protected in Write mode, and the) 1802 SB
