225 700 801 (                                   H: Physical Error) 801 SB
225 937 1663 (    The Search For Next function is identical to the Search For First function, except) 1663 SB
225 996 1696 (   that the directory scan continues from the last entry that was matched.  Function 18) 1696 SB
225 1055 1328 (   returns a Directory code in register A, analogous to Function 17.) 1328 SB
225 1174 1696 (   Note: in execution sequence, a Function 18 call must follow either a Function 17 or) 1696 SB
225 1233 1716 (   another Function 18 call with no other intervening BDOS disk-related function calls.) 1716 SB
