225 227 1680 (     Error Code 01 is returned if   no data exists at the next record position of the file.) 1680 SB
225 286 1659 (   Usually, the no data situation   is encountered at the end of a file. However, it can) 1659 SB
225 345 1644 (   also occur if an attempt is made to read a data block that has not been previously) 1644 SB
225 405 1776 (   written, or an extent which has not been created.  These situations are usually restricted) 1776 SB
225 464 1684 (   to files created or appended with the BDOS random write functions \(see Functions) 1684 SB
225 523 266 (   34 and 40\).) 266 SB
225 641 1779 (     Error Code 09 is returned if the FCB is invalidated by a previous BDOS close call that) 1779 SB
225 700 362 (   returns an error.) 362 SB
225 819 1632 (     Error Code 10 is returned if a media change occurs on the drive after the refer-) 1632 SB
225 878 1157 (   enced FCB is activated by a BDOS Open, or Make Call.) 1157 SB
225 996 1680 (     Error Code 255 is returned if a physical error is encountered and the BDOS error) 1680 SB
225 1055 1726 (   mode is Return Error mode, or Return and Display Error mode \(see Function 45\).  If) 1726 SB
225 1115 1662 (   the error mode is the default mode, a message identifying the physical error is dis-) 1662 SB
225 1174 1693 (   played at the console, and the calling program is terminated.  When a physical error) 1693 SB
225 1233 1629 (   is returned to the calling program, register H contains one of the following error) 1629 SB
225 1292 167 (   codes:) 167 SB
225 1410 477 (        01   Disk I/O error) 477 SB
225 1470 554 (        04   Invalid drive error) 554 SB
225 1588 1640 (     On all error returns except for physical error returns, A = 255, Function 20 sets) 1640 SB
225 1647 1728 (   register H to the number of records successfully read before the error is encountered.) 1728 SB
225 1706 1658 (   This value can range from 0 to 127 depending on the current BDOS Multi-Sector) 1658 SB
225 1765 1559 (   Count.  It is always set to zero when the Multi-Sector Count is equal to one.) 1559 SB
1154 2830 92 (3-30) 92 SB
225 92 861 (BDOS Function Calls                                 ) 861 SB
