225 286 1780 (         Section 2.3.4.\) Attributes fl' through f4' are not presently used, but can be useful for) 1780 SB
225 345 1751 (         application programs, because they are not involved in the matching program used) 1751 SB
225 405 1776 (         by the BDOS during Open File and Close File operations.  Indicators f5' through f8') 1776 SB
225 464 959 (         are reserved for use as interface attributes.) 959 SB
