225 819 1754 (         The Lock Record function is an MP/M II function that is supported under CP/M 3) 1754 SB
225 878 1748 (        only to provide compatibility between CP/M 3 and MP/M.  It is intended for use in) 1748 SB
225 937 1736 (        situations where more than one running program has Read-Write access to a com-) 1736 SB
225 996 1755 (        mon file.  Because CP/M 3 is a single-user operating system in which only one pro-) 1755 SB
225 1055 1747 (        gram can run at a time, this situation cannot occur.  Thus, under CP/M 3, Function) 1747 SB
225 1115 1717 (        42 performs no action except to return the value 00H in register A indicating that) 1717 SB
225 1174 877 (        the record lock operation is successful.) 877 SB
