225 996 1765 (          The Get Disk Free Space function determines the number of free sectors, 128 byte) 1765 SB
225 1055 1679 (        records, on the specified drive.  The calling program passes the drive number in) 1679 SB
225 1115 1777 (        register E, with 0 for drive A, 1 for B, and so on, through 15 for drive P in a full 16-) 1777 SB
225 1174 1764 (        drive system.  Function 46 returns a binary number in the first 3 bytes of the current) 1764 SB
225 1233 1344 (        DMA buffer.  This number is returned in the following format:) 1344 SB
225 1351 828 (                                            fso    fsl   fs2) 828 SB
