225 1588 909 (                                           fso = low      byte) 909 SB
225 1647 889 (                                           fsl = middle byte) 889 SB
225 1706 906 (                                           fs2 = high     byte) 906 SB
225 1825 1713 (          Note that the returned free space value might be inaccurate if the drive has been) 1713 SB
225 1884 492 (        marked Read-Only.) 492 SB
