225 760 1628 (      Function 50 provides a direct BIOS call through the BDOS to the BIOS.  The) 1628 SB
225 819 1658 (    calling program passes the address of a data structure called the BIOS Parameter) 1658 SB
225 878 1792 (    Block \(BIOSPB\) in register pair DE.  The BIOSPB contains the BIOS function number) 1792 SB
225 937 808 (    and register contents as shown below:) 808 SB
