225 227 1331 (       You can prepare the above programs for execution as follows:) 1331 SB
225 345 1353 (         1. Assemble the CALLVERS program using MAC as follows:) 1353 SB
225 405 537 (            MAC CALLVERS) 537 SB
225 464 1266 (         2. Generate a COM file for CALLVERS with HEXCOM:) 1266 SB
225 523 641 (            HEXCOM CALLVERS) 641 SB
225 582 1291 (         3. Assemble the RSX program ECHOVERS using RMAC:) 1291 SB
225 641 578 (            RMAC ECHOYERS) 578 SB
225 700 1104 (         4. Generate a PRL file using the LINK command:) 1104 SB
225 760 662 (            LINK ECHOVERS [OPI) 662 SB
225 819 894 (         S. Rename the PRL file to an RSX file:) 894 SB
225 878 1161 (            RENAME ECHOVERS*RSX=ECHOVERS.PRL) 1161 SB
225 937 1673 (         6. Generate a COM file with an attached RSX using the GENCOM command:) 1673 SB
225 996 918 (            GENCOM CALLVERS ECHOVERS) 918 SB
225 1055 893 (         7. Run the CALLVERS.COM module:) 893 SB
